From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:39:50 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: spi: describe T8011 PIO status setup

Allow the T8011 compatible before the T8010 and generic SPI fallbacks. Its long full-duplex PIO transfers require the native status configuration.

[Orchard: from OrchardLinux/orchard#205 (tompta1, 09038adf),
 kernel/patches/drivers/spi/0011-dt-bindings-spi-describe-T8011-PIO-status-setup.patch; rebased onto main, otherwise unchanged.]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
index c8ed3039b..1fce58692 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/apple,spi.yaml
@@ -28,7 +28,9 @@ properties:
   compatible:
     oneOf:
       - items:
-          - const: apple,t8015-spi
+          - enum:
+              - apple,t8011-spi
+              - apple,t8015-spi
           - const: apple,t8010-spi
           - const: apple,spi
       - items:
